/*
 * deploy-pending-note.compact — no circuit; mainnet deploy-pending pointer only.
 * Official deploy docs (https://docs.midnight.network/guides/deploy-and-operate) describe
 * deployContract / submitDeployTx. They do not document a public --filter-deploy-txs flag.
 * Upstream servicedesk#257 reports that valid mainnet contract-deploy txs stay in public
 * RPC pools until TTL (validate_transaction Valid, apply_extrinsic Ok) while contract calls
 * are included. The report asks whether producers or relays still run --filter-deploy-txs.
 * Compact has no node-pool API. This file only pins the known symptom for builders.
 * LOCAL-TRUE. No on-chain deploy is claimed. Does not fix the public node or indexer.
 *
 * Upstream: https://github.com/midnightntwrk/servicedesk/issues/257
 * Pins: Compact ~0.31.1 / language ~0.23, midnight-js 4.1.1, DApp Connector 4.0.1, proof-server 8.1.0.
 *
 * Built by @kshot9000 https://x.com/kshot9000
 * Email: kshot9000@gmail.com
 * Cardano donation: addr1q8hnl6vl5a6k3rw3n5g3jtte696zcl76kfatzv7gpswa9r0dj7fma6klq55y4ffm7tf0em09udnyhuk4ah92pl5x9jpqjae44v
 * Teams: @midnightntwrk @MidnightNtwrk @midnightfdn @Cardano @InputOutputHK @cardano-foundation
 */

pragma language_version >= 0.22 && <= 0.23;

import CompactStandardLibrary;

// No exported circuit. Deploy-pending classification is off-chain.
